{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06392","headline":"欲之新乡荅崔颢綦毋潜 · 李颀","name":"欲之新乡荅崔颢綦毋潜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"数年作吏家屡空，谁道黑头成老翁。\n男儿在世无产业，行子出门如转蓬。\n吾属交欢此何夕，南家捣衣动归客。\n铜鑪将炙相欢饮，星宿纵横露华白。\n寒风卷叶度滹沱，飞雪布地悲峨峨。\n孤城日落见栖鸟，马上时闻渔者歌。\n明朝东路把君手，腊日辞君期岁首。\n自知寂寞无去思，敢望县人致牛酒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}